Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:03.59,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}跑吧跑吧 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:07.07,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:09.50,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正你會跟上來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.58,0:22:12.70,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊先生 熊先生 我都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.46,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然被發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.35,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}畢竟我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:21.43,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:24.08,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}la se！la se la se la─
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:27.37,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒有信號 傳不到這
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.85,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi 雖然是有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:33.20,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}便利商店 都不是便利商店了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.71,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為是鄉下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.77,0:22:41.66,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}太陽落山 夜幕降臨 山中小徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.86,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}1 2 3 4 DJ here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.89,0:22:47.31,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK 村民 check it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:50.29,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 熊出村的巫女小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:53.16,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好可愛 好可愛 還說沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:56.08,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}哥哥也好 姐姐也好 都是滑菇妖怪 怪怪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:57.58,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒錯 沒錯 沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.61,0:22:59.02,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就是熊巫女之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:01.91,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正是熊巫女 DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:04.79,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不跳的話 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:07.68,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}明天也在這個村子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.94,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無論如何 都是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:14.87,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然還是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:19.34,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}超級Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:22.12,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}everybody body 大家Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:23.59,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好 就寢
