Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:56.99,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.86,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我今天也有點慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:31.32,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}啊　睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:33.12,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.87,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:36.60,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.27,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:40.17,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:47.19,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:50.06,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:56.21,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.86,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:04.42,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.32,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:11.51,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.86,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.50,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:23.62,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.84,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:29.20,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:32.77,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
